Flappy MGU 1.0.0

Original game simulation and vector artwork, inspired by the Flappy Bird mechanic.
No original Flappy Bird sprites, audio or source code are redistributed.
The repository aaarafat/JS-Flappy-Bird was studied as a gameplay reference only
(commit 1c704918d55383066b6f40f2689efcce3e1d5a69; no license present at review).

The CommonJS kit runtime, permissions and generated RHMI resources are based on
https://github.com/cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps
commit e2716cdd8d779141262a078fe192cade6cf26f4b, MIT.
See third-party/idrive7-apps-LICENSE and javascript/kit/fonts/OFL-NotoSansSC.txt.
Only the game's transitive runtime modules are included; diagnostic modules,
build tools and unused localization catalogs are omitted. Runtime source is
unmodified. The game UI is English. No SDK-dependent browserify bundle is included.

https://github.com/robertnisipeanu/mgu-store
commit d878bed5ce5848d0c1ce852be23fac539e434a0b was studied for installation
and repository formats. No Store code is redistributed.

BMW, iDrive and Flappy Bird names belong to their respective owners.
This is an independent, unofficial project. No BMW SDK, firmware, keys,
vehicle identifiers or OEM images are included.
